{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "The Brave New World of the Internet", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "How to Adapt", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 4, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 10, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Explain about technology and technical problems in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Consonant Blends - the<span class=\"italic\"> shr </span>Sound", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Consonant clusters like  <span class=\"italic\">shr</span> can occur at the beginning of a word in English.<br/>Practice blending the sound from one consonant sound into the next without adding a vowel sound in between.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Read the following words aloud.<br/><br/>Example:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shrink\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shrank\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" shrunk\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" shrewd\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shred\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" shredder\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shriek\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shrug\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: I feel like my social circle has shrunk because of social media.<br><span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Yeah. It makes me want to put these useless debates through a shredder.\t", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Intonation in Long Questions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " Intonation is important in statements and in long questions. You use the rise and fall of your voice to show the listener when you are or are not finished.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "In long questions, the intonation falls and then rises to show the question is not finished. The intonation rises or falls at the end, depending on whether it is a  yes/no question or a piece of information.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say these sentences. Vary the intonation on the bolded words. Be sure to notice if the question is an information or yes/no question.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You don't <span class=\"strong\">think</span> that computers help people <span class=\"strong\">connect</span> with each <span class=\"strong\">other</span>?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Do you <span class=\"strong\">mean</span> you don't enjoy the <span class=\"strong\">time</span> you spend <span class=\"strong\">online</span>?  ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Don't you <span class=\"strong\">think</span> you should <span class=\"strong\">try</span> to adapt <span class=\"strong\">instead</span>?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "advocate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who strongly supports a cause or an idea", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I just had the most amazing interview with a technology advocate.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about the negative effects of technology.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "scenario", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a possible outcome", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I don't think I'm looking forward to a scenario where virtual reality takes over the world.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to shrug", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to raise one's shoulders to express doubt or indifference", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Why are you shrugging? You don't think that computers can connect everyone?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "dependent", "type": "name"}, {"content": "relying on something or someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I think we're becoming too dependent on electronic devices.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to shrink", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to get smaller; to reduce ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I feel like my social circle has shrunk because of social media.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "forum", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a public space", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Every time I visit a forum, everyone shouts at each other for no reason. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to shriek ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to produce high-pitched, piercing sounds", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: When I read online comments all I hear is people shrieking at me.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob04aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "luddite", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a person with a strong dislike for technology", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You're such a luddite. Don't you think you should try to adapt instead?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob04aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "shredder", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a machine in an office used to destroy something, usually documents", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  It makes me want to put these useless debates through a shredder.\t", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob04aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "With a partner, talk about the dangers of new technologies and the problem of becoming dependent on electronic devices.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a dialogue of 12 - 14 lines on this topic.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Give information on the problem. Stress the new information.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask for clarification. Stress the correct words in the questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Try to disagree with your partner. Stress the important words in your statements.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use at least 3 words with the <span class=\"italic\">shr</span> sound.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I use words with the <span class=\"italic\">shr</span> sound.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I stress new information.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use the proper intonation in long questions and statements.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss the problems associated with new technologies.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about technology.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can say and use the sound shr.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can use proper intonation in statements and questions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Do you think you behave differently online compared to real life? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you think we rely on our devices too much? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "